{% set current_page = 'admissions' %}
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>学校与招生政策 · 导师库</title>
<style>
main{margin:auto;padding:28px 22px}.intro{max-width:850px;line-height:1.8}.policy-filters{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:18px;margin:22px 0}.policy-filters label{display:grid;gap:7px;min-width:120px}.policy-filters input,.policy-filters select{padding:8px;max-width:230px}.policy-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px}.unit-directory,.policy-card,.unit-summary{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:18px;min-width:0}.unit-directory{max-height:700px;overflow:auto}.unit-directory button{display:block;text-align:left;width:100%;margin:5px 0;line-height:1.6}.unit-directory button[aria-current]{background:var(--soft);border-color:var(--accent)}.unit-summary{margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.8}.unit-summary h2{margin-top:0}.policy-card{margin-bottom:18px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.policy-card h2{margin:4px 0 12px}.scope{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.quality{padding:9px 12px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:var(--soft);line-height:1.7;margin:14px 0}.quality:not(.checked){background:#fbf0dc;border-color:#98601d;color:#805219}.policy-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.policy-field{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px;min-width:0}.policy-field h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px}.policy-field p{line-height:1.8;margin:5px 0}.policy-field blockquote{margin:8px 0;padding-left:10px;border-left:2px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}.empty{padding:22px;border:1px dashed var(--line);background:white;line-height:1.8}.stats{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}#unit-entries{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.policy-age{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:850px){.policy-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.unit-directory{max-height:180px}.policy-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.policy-filters{gap:10px;padding:14px}.policy-filters label{min-width:0;flex:1 1 140px}.policy-filters input,.policy-filters select{width:100%}.policy-card{padding:16px}}
</style>{% include '_ui_head.html.j2' %}</head><body>{% include '_nav.html.j2' %}<main>
<h1>先了解学校，再核对申请要求</h1><p class="intro muted">学校通用规则、院系要求与具体专业安排分别查看。每项摘要都有原文定位；未整理或尚未公布的信息仍需核实。政策不直接证明你符合资格，也不代表某位导师有名额。</p>
<style>.unit-info{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0}.unit-info h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:16px}.unit-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:0}.unit-metrics dt{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.unit-metrics dd{margin:6px 0;font-size:22px;color:var(--accent)}.unit-metrics small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:850px){.unit-metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}</style>
<p id="policy-coverage" class="stats"></p>
<p class="stats">为CS学生提供相关院系导航；标签按院系名称归类，不表示该院系接受你的本科专业，需核对招生规则。</p>
<label>相关院系方向<select id="policy-group"><option value="">全部相关院系</option></select></label>
<div class="policy-filters"><label>招生范围<select id="policy-track"><option value="">全部</option><option value="ordinary">普通招生</option><option value="special">工程硕博士专项</option></select></label><label>学校<select id="policy-school"></select></label><label>院系<select id="policy-dept"></select></label><label>入学年度<input id="policy-year" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" placeholder="留空看全部年度"></label><label>学位<select id="policy-degree"><option value="">全部</option><option value="master">硕士</option><option value="phd">博士</option></select></label><label>渠道<select id="policy-route"><option value="">全部</option><option value="recommend">推免</option><option value="exam">统考</option><option value="assessment">申请考核</option></select></label></div>
<div class="policy-layout"><aside class="unit-directory"><h2>学校目录</h2><p class="muted">人数为本库记录，不是当前官方师资总数。</p><div id="school-directory"></div><h2>院系覆盖</h2><div id="unit-directory-list"></div></aside><section><div id="unit-summary" class="unit-summary"><h2 id="unit-name"></h2><p id="unit-description"></p><div id="unit-readiness" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="unit-entries"></div><div id="unit-catalog"></div><div class="actions"><a id="unit-mentors">查看对应导师 →</a><a id="unit-notices">查看院系通知 →</a></div></div><p id="policy-count" class="stats" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="policy-list"></div></section></div>
<p class="stats">来源检查只覆盖已登记正文与附件，不保证官网没有新通知。成功读取、人工摘要核对与当前报名开放是不同状态。具体报名必须同时核对学校、院系、专业和报考点要求。</p>
</main><script src="admissions-data.js"></script><script src="admissions-core.js"></script><script src="admissions.js"></script></body></html>
